Package: scExploreRFinal
Title: Single-Cell RNA-Seq Explorer with PCA Visualization
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Leya", "Alexander",
           email = "leyaalexander@usf.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An educational toolkit for exploring single-cell RNA
    sequencing (scRNA-seq) data. Provides functions for PCA
    visualization, descriptive statistics, and hypothesis testing
    (t-tests, Wilcoxon, ANOVA) of gene expression data with
    defensive input validation. Demonstrates three R plotting
    systems (Base Graphics, Lattice, and ggplot2) on a bundled
    subset of the 10x Genomics PBMC dataset. Final project for
    LIS4370 Advanced R Programming, University of South Florida.
Author: Leya Alexander [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Leya Alexander <leyaalexander@usf.edu>
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    ggplot2,
    lattice
